cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Enterprise ML Platform"
abstract: >-
  A reference implementation of a production machine learning platform,
  written to show how the parts of an ML system fit together: reproducible
  training, versioned features, a model registry with alias-based promotion,
  an HTTP serving layer, and controlled deployment to AWS SageMaker. It is a
  study rather than a product. Pipeline orchestration with compensating
  rollback, a Redis online feature store, a Parquet offline store with
  point-in-time retrieval, an MLflow-backed model registry, and a FastAPI
  serving layer are implemented and covered by tests; distributed training,
  the security and compliance modules, and the Kubernetes and Terraform
  assets are scaffolding and are labelled as such.
